course: dictionary
lesson: 11686
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the context tells you which one is right. The word «attachment» is a good example. Look at the words around it and ask: what would make sense here?
explain: «Check your email. There is an attachment at the bottom.» Here an attachment is a file sent with an email. The clues are email and bottom, and a file sent with a message fits best.
explain: «Her attachment to her grandad grew stronger every year.» Here attachment means a feeling of love and closeness. Try the first meaning in the sentence: a file sent to her grandad makes no sense, so this must be a feeling.
explain: «Snap the drill attachment onto the drill.» The third meaning is an extra part you fix onto a machine. Clues like snap, onto and drill show you which meaning is right.
fact: «Attachment» is a noun. You can say an attachment or attachments.
fact: «Attachment» means a file sent with an email.
fact: «Attachment» means a feeling of love or closeness to someone or something.
fact: «Attachment» also means an extra part you can fix onto a machine, like a vacuum cleaner attachment.
fact: Never open an attachment from a stranger, because it might harm your computer.
exercise: «Please send your project to me as an attachment.» What does attachment mean here? | A feeling of closeness to a friend | A short walk | *A file sent with an email | An extra part for a machine
exercise: «Use the vacuum cleaner attachment to clean the sofa.» What is the attachment? | *An extra part fixed onto the machine | A feeling of love | A message from a stranger
exercise: «Babies form a strong attachment to their parents.» What does attachment mean here? | A short holiday | *A feeling of love and closeness | An extra part for a machine | A file sent with an email
test: Mum said, «Never open an attachment from a stranger.» What is an attachment here? | A stranger's name | A feeling of trust | *A file sent with an email | A kind of machine
test: Nadia's attachment to her old teddy bear made it hard to throw him away. What does attachment mean? | A file sent with an email | *A feeling of closeness and love | A part for a vacuum cleaner | A broken toy
exam: «The hoover came with a long attachment for the stairs.» What does attachment mean? | A file sent by email | Dust | *An extra part for the hoover | A feeling of love
